      "claim": "The average adult human skull has a biparietal diameter of about 140 mm and an anteroposterior length of about 170 mm.",
      "evidence": "Forensic anthropometry (e.g., White & Folkens, 2005) reports mean adult cranial dimensions of 13–14 cm biparietally and 16–17 cm front‑to‑back.",
